	(text "ZONA MAINS TERISOLASI (audit §11.3 / keputusan D5): net L_AC, N_AC,\n  L_AC_FUSED (DN-S5-04) = class MAINS_AC — DRC custom MAINS_SELV_CREEPAGE\n  (clearance >= 6,4 mm ke SEMUA net non-MAINS_AC) + MAINS_LN_SPACING\n  (L-N >= 6,4 mm) — rule .kicad_dru sejak S0. Lebar 0,5 mm cukup\n  (arus sampling mA — CT eksternal mengukur arus beban).\nJ_PZEM_AC = Dinkle DT-55 P10 (DN-S5-06): tepi pad L-N 10-3,3=6,7 mm\n  >= 6,4; keluarga sama dgn J_ACS (S3); rating 300V >= 250VAC\n  (verifikasi BOM S10).\nF3 1A slow 250VAC 5x20 (clip Littelfuse 111, dua clip 20 mm) di jalur L;\n  RV3 MOV 275VAC DNP-opsional melintang L-N sesudah fuse (cascade\n  fuse->MOV; DN-S5-08).\nSLOT MILLED di board outline antara zona mains & SELV (dimensi final S9);\n  SILKSCREEN peringatan HV bergaris wajib di zona mains (S9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 108 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a99fa25-0f9b-4ab4-a709-fd62b7307eaf")	)
	(text "M_PZEM socket modul PZEM-004T v3.0 100A-CT (DNP rev awal — DN-S5-07):\n  L/N (kiri, MAINS) <- L_AC_FUSED/N_AC via wiring harness socket;\n  TTL (kanan, SELV): 5V<-+5V (~25 mA), GND->DGND, TX->R55 1k ->\n  PZEM_RX (GPIO18), RX<-PZEM_TX (GPIO19). Modul terisolasi opto\n  internal (audit §11.3: sisi TTL murni SELV).\nCLAMP D30 BAV199 (dual-series SOT-23; pinning = BAV99 — DN-S5-03):\n  pin3=PZEM_RX node, pin1->DGND (clamp -0,7V), pin2->+3V3 (clamp\n  3,3+0,7=4,0V). R55 1k membatasi: level 5V modul -> (5-4,0)/1k=1 mA\n  ke clamp+ESD internal — dalam toleransi; level TTL aktual =\n  VERIFIKASI SAAT MODUL DIPASANG (asumsi #7 / M4 / OPEN-003R).\nFW-SYNC: driver PZEM DEFAULT-DISABLED (§31) — aktif hanya bila modul\n  terpasang; Modbus-RTU 9600 8N1 addr 0x01 default; init cek presence.\nDimensi modul/pinout = VERIFIKASI UNIT FISIK (OPEN-003R); footprint\n  Module_PZEM_004T_Socket (2 pad mains 10 mm + 1x04 P2,54, terpisah\n  50 mm; slot isolasi melintasi tengah footprint saat S9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 138 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9ad7ee01-5919-4660-bba6-8c5102f5d94d")	)
	(text "PENEMPATAN (S9): seluruh zona mains di tepi board terpisah; J_PZEM_AC\n  + F3 + RV3 + pad L/N M_PZEM dalam satu region; TIDAK ada net SELV\n  melintasi region; routing MAINS satu layer (top), jauh dari antenna\n  & analog. ENCLOSURE: akses servis F3 dari luar (fuse dapat diganti\n  tanpa membuka zona lain); label tegangan pada silkscreen.\nERC: M_PZEM & RV3 DNP tetap masuk netlist (verifikasi konektivitas);\n  tidak ada PWR_FLAG baru (L/N dari connector eksternal, pin pasif)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 168 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "185a136a-befb-4d34-9eb4-db50f7e3cf6a")	)
	(text_box "10_PZEM — socket PZEM-004T v3.0 di zona isolasi mains (S5).\nJ_PZEM_AC (L_AC/N_AC, Dinkle DT-55 P10 — DN-S5-06) + F3 1A slow 250VAC\n  di jalur L + RV3 MOV 275VAC DNP -> net L_AC/N_AC/L_AC_FUSED class\n  MAINS_AC (DN-S5-04; clearance 6,4 mm DRC custom + slot milled S9).\nM_PZEM (DNP, custom plts-custom:M_PZEM — DN-S5-07): L<-L_AC_FUSED,\n  N<-N_AC; TTL: 5V->+5V, GND->DGND, TX->R55 1k->PZEM_RX (GPIO18) +\n  clamp D30 BAV199 (pin1 DGND / pin2 +3V3 / pin3 sinyal — DN-S5-03),\n  RX<-PZEM_TX (GPIO19). Firmware default-disabled (§31).\nGATE S5: boundary MAINS 6,4 mm (DRC custom rule aktif + netclass);\n  TVS semua connector eksternal (D10/D20 sheet 07/08); FW-SYNC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 42)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b3ab002f-048d-451d-a2b9-fcc891ec1ed4")
	)
